    "edit_note": "Placeholder \u6d77\u90fd\u653e\u9001\u30bb\u30f3\u30bf\u30fc (an original broadcast centre that REPLACES the old Tokyo Tower model): 90 x 60 podium (18 m), a 34 x 26 tower to 120 m on its back half, a helipad and a 60 m banded mast. The game assumes: a landmark seen from across the city (it streams at 3 km), the collider is the mesh, the front (-Y) faces the street; the helipad is the planned rooftop mission set piece."
